{"id":"31d33c686ede20f6adf2e6f52c97e5f8a84ae849","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1231290","title":"大家每个月在 AI 工具上花多少钱？我算了下已经 500 -1000 多了","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"grindmule","excerpt":"程序员 - @grindmule - 最近的 AI 工具感觉越定越多，单看貌似不多，但是认真算了一下，叠加起来也不少了我目前大概是：ChatGPT Plus：20 美元/月Claude/Gemini：20 美元左右/月","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>最近的 AI 工具感觉越定越多，单看貌似不多，但是认真算了一下，叠加起来也不少了</p>\n<p>我目前大概是：\nChatGPT Plus：20 美元/月\nClaude/Gemini：20 美元左右/月\nAI 编程工具：10-30 美元左右/月\nAPI 和其他零散工具：10 ～ 50 美元/月\n这些加起来，每个月也是快小 100 美元了，一个月折合人民币多的时候一千多了。</p>\n<p>这些工具也不是每个都能用满额，也不是都不可替代，但是偶尔确实有需要使用；有时候觉得模型能力差别没那么大，真正让我不想退订的，反而是使用习惯、上下文、编程工作流和响应速度。</p>\n<p>所以比较好奇大家目前是啥情况？</p>\n<p>每个月在 AI 、API 这些地方要花掉多少预算？</p>\n<p>不知道我这个属于正常水平，还是有些浪费呢？</p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/AI\"><li></li> AI</a><a href=\"/tag/花费\"><li></li> 花费</a><a href=\"/tag/工具\"><li></li> 工具</a></P><p><span>69 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-08-01 14:36:01 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925572\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/fc6a087da323c792f0feda5a4eaa9374?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"BananaZC\" data-uid=\"484818\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/BananaZC\">BananaZC</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 16:58:08 +08:00\">21h 53m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>两个人合买了一个 20x 的 codex<br>，一个人 500 多吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925635\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/683e/710d/583505_normal.png?m=1776159443\" alt=\"lyxxxh2\" data-uid=\"583505\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lyxxxh2\">lyxxxh2</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 17:06:48 +08:00\">21h 44m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>claude pro:170 *3  = ￥ 510<br>加上其他的,估计￥ 600</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925652\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/fd3d/e72c/430477_normal.png?m=1569461183\" alt=\"EthanV2\" data-uid=\"430477\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/EthanV2\">EthanV2</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 17:10:18 +08:00\">21h 41m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>零氪，白嫖 trae ，中转站，qoder ，codebuddy ，还有一些比如美团龙猫，商汤日日新，零零碎碎的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925684\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9da1/d8ae/352325_normal.png?m=1708952363\" alt=\"TimPeake\" data-uid=\"352325\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/TimPeake\">TimPeake</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 17:15:08 +08:00\">21h 36m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>看个人实力吧 消费的起就没问题。能白嫖公司的肯定白嫖公司统一采购的 AI 。对于上淘宝买 5 块钱的激活码都要比价的我来说，自费 20 美元 上班毫无疑问相当于卖血了 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/rjR4rdr.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rjR4rdr.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925703\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7109/682f/314987_normal.png?m=1572320906\" alt=\"jamshes\" data-uid=\"314987\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jamshes\">jamshes</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 17:18:42 +08:00\">21h 32m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 2</span>\n                    \n                    <p>以前没 ai 的时候，大家不需要付出这部分钱，现在有 ai ，效率是提高了，但是活也多了，工作时长不变，工作还多了支出。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925711\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6159/9999/582231_normal.png?m=1754617848\" alt=\"Nasdaq\" data-uid=\"582231\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Nasdaq\">Nasdaq</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 17:20:13 +08:00\">21h 31m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>1000-1500 USD</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925722\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c4c7/ff66/293320_normal.png?m=1782224054\" alt=\"zhuanggu\" data-uid=\"293320\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zhuanggu\">zhuanggu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 17:22:01 +08:00\">21h 29m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>基本不花钱，ChatGPT 免费版 + DeepSeek 轮着用就够了。</p><p>但有个更大的成本——不同 AI 给的好答案，过几天想找回来特别费时间。后来自己做了个 Chrome 插件（ SaveAnswer ），AI 回答旁边加个 Save 按钮就存本地了，跨平台搜起来快很多。也是免费的。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925829\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3f42/923a/676983_normal.png?m=1782816911\" alt=\"eventlooped\" data-uid=\"676983\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/eventlooped\">eventlooped</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 17:50:15 +08:00\">21h 1m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>按当前近似汇率计算：<br>GPT Plus：499 里拉 ≈ 71.31 元<br>Claude Pro：999 里拉 ≈ 142.76 元<br>静态家宽 IP：14 美元 ÷ 3 个月 ≈ 31.60 元/月<br>梯子：185 元 ÷ 3 个月 ≈ 61.67 元/月<br>里拉按约 1 TRY = 0.1429 CNY ，美元按约 1 USD = 6.7713 CNY 估算。<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://Investing.com\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Investing.com</a><br>每月合计<br>约 307.33 元/月</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925840\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c854/a6b5/123312_normal.png?m=1434923027\" alt=\"jh623\" data-uid=\"123312\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jh623\">jh623</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 17:53:25 +08:00\">20h 58m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>每天用 agent 的时长 10 个小时以上，持续了一个多月了，至今花了 3 块钱</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925846\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b349/a1af/415096_normal.png?m=1618586856\" alt=\"lujiaosama\" data-uid=\"415096\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lujiaosama\">lujiaosama</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 17:54:38 +08:00\">20h 57m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>AI 本身的花费就不说了.为了 AI 办理了 VISA 信用卡, 搞了台二手 IPHONE,搞 GG 卡冲了 10 英镑, 充值了 20 刀的接码平台,开了两个好一点的梯子一个月 80 块.</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925902\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7ee92fc40a6c8ab3e4ebba24675b6e8e?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"vultr\" data-uid=\"188988\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>20</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/vultr\">vultr</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-31 18:12:48 +08:00\">20h 38m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>买了 5 个 20x pro, 1000 美元；还有团队账号，grok, gemini 等，大概 1200 的样子吧。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17925943\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/da2c/3049/645050_normal.png?m=1784194513\" alt